{"site":"douban","sid":"26809023","douban_link":"https://movie.douban.com/subject/26809023/","chinese_title":"13","foreign_title":"","year":"1977","aka":[],"region":["中国香港"],"genre":["剧情","惊悚","家庭","犯罪"],"language":["粤语"],"playdate":["1977-05-23(中国香港)"],"episodes":"11","duration":"25分钟","description":"该剧为十一集单元剧，剧集分别为《尸体》《圣女》《分离》《杀妻》（上、下集）《窒息》《花劫》（上、中、下集）《弑父》《芳踪》。\n1977年，谭家明继《七女性》之后策划了另一个由他主导的片集系列《13》。命名《13》，是取西方文化里“十三不祥”之意；《13》每集独立，全部都是围绕凶杀、变态人物、不伦关係等偏锋题材。《13》原拟拍13集，但最终只拍了11集，全部由谭家明导演。 《13》是谭家明电视时期里较晚的作品（此后他只帮忙导演过一集《小人物》），他在形式与风格上的鍊炼在此可谓达致一个比较成熟的境界。例如《弑父》里可见他严谨地以推轨镜头贯穿全片的视觉风格，与及贯彻地控制著女主角陈玉莲的表演。值得一提的是，《13》也有一些鲜在谭家明身上见到的面貌。例如《尸体》写一对夫妇如何应对一个荒诞处境，便充满意料之外的黑色幽默，那种谐趣是几乎没有在谭家明的电影中出现过的。","poster":"https://img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l_ratio_poster/public/p2619210351.jpg","douban_votes":"240","douban_rating":"7.4","director":[{"name":"谭家明 Patrick Tam","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27504174/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1480345517.55.webp"}],"writer":[{"name":"陈韵文 Joyce Chan","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27508702/","role":"编剧 Writer","avatar":"https://img2.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1490952479.91.webp"}],"cast":[{"name":"苗金凤 Miu Kam Fung","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27492897/","role":"演员 Actress","avatar":"https://img1.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1602161192.78.webp"},{"name":"缪骞人 Cora Miao","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27229472/","role":"演员 Actress","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p3423.webp"},{"name":"韦以茵 Wai Yee Yan","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/35630426/","role":"演员 Actress","avatar":"https://img2.doubanio.com/view/personage/m/public/d836bbb2cb29964a0c0197498c5bf4ae.jpg"},{"name":"朱江 Kong Chu","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27509041/","role":"演员 Actor","avatar":"https://img1.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p20268.webp"},{"name":"黄杏秀 Cecilia Wong","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27481639/",